text:
The plate is square-ish and about 20-22 cm across, so I treated it as a side plate. The food is roasted sweet potato cubes, about 13 pieces. Each cube is roughly 3 cm × 3 cm × 2 cm, which is about 15-18 cm³, or roughly 15 g per piece. That gives about 190 g for all 13 pieces. Some pieces are smaller, so I settled on about 170 g.

Roasted sweet potato is about 120 kcal per 100 g, which allows for a little oil. I could not see any separate oil or sauce on the plate.

